WEBVTT

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:04.562
Hiroshi here. This story is a fiction.

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Downloaded From www.AllSubs.org

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:05.705
Fiction...

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:07.374
In order to get free rent...

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.476
We have turn Sunako into a lady, but...

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:11.011
What the hell are we supposed to do...

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.844
When she bleeds from her nose
every time she sees us?

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:17.117
She doesn't bleed from her nose
when she sees my face.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:18.482
You don't have to show us your face!

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:22.689
Ah, on the nights that I think of you

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:27.660
In the midst of the sweet-scented breeze

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.697
I can feel soothing tenderness

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:38.229
Pass through me

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.938
The Wallflower

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:50.478
It hurts because I know painfully well

00:00:53.953 --> 00:01:01.257
That it will be sad when the conversation ends

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:10.092
Now I've detached myself

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:16.564
From the freedom called loneliness

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:23.817
Ah, on the nights that I think of you

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:28.311
In the midst of the sweet-scented breeze

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.758
I can feel soothing tenderness

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:38.891
Pass through me

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:56.883
Man, I'm hungry.

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:58.017
Listen to you...

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.450
He has no class.

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:01.387
Who gives a damn about that!

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:03.514
Hey, what's for tonight's dinner?

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:07.160
So radiant... It's too radiant!

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:10.129
Before I get melted by this light...

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.593
I must kill him!

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:14.701
With my own hands, I'll make the most
beautiful corpse out of him.

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.532
The most beautiful...

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:19.239
She's bleeding from the nose again?!

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:20.840
I'm surprised she's not dead.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.899
I'm right on the edge though.

00:02:23.243 --> 00:02:24.978
You're Kyohei Takano, correct?

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:25.812
What?

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:28.715
We heard about you and decided
to come see you.

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:30.049
Do you have a few minutes to...

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:31.175
No!

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:34.087
I bet you're from a host club, right?

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:35.889
I'm not into that kind of thing.

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:37.524
Oh, come on, just listen to us.

00:02:37.524 --> 00:02:38.691
No way!

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:40.693
We'll pay you a million yen as compensation!

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:42.718
Whoa, the highest amount ever!

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:46.627
I don't care how much you pay me, I won't do it!
Go find someone else.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.801
All right, let's get something to eat!

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.103
This is a problem...

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:51.900
