00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:54.872
Anyway, that's what happened.

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:56.765
That's pretty cool!

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:58.444
I guess so.

00:02:58.444 --> 00:02:59.913
I don't get it.

00:02:59.913 --> 00:03:01.247
Yeah, I see what you mean.

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:02.549
That's pretty cool!

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:03.783
I'll go prepare dinner.
I guess so.

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:04.951
I'll go prepare dinner.
I don't get it.

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:05.246
I don't get it.

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:06.812
Do you want me to help you?

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:08.588
No, thank you.

00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:10.522
