00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:33.137
This is what life's about: entertainment!

00:03:33.546 --> 00:03:35.173
I don't get it!

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:37.149
Welcome back.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.182
We've been eagerly awaiting your return.

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:41.788
Where's Sunako?

00:03:41.788 --> 00:03:43.449
Where is Sunako?

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:46.684
Um, you see, Sunako is...

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:49.162
