00:14:40.212 --> 00:14:41.680
Cool and beautiful!

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:43.415
Is she some company president's
daughter or something?

00:14:43.415 --> 00:14:46.418
Is she a model? She's so tall! How lovely!

00:14:46.418 --> 00:14:47.820
She's so cute!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.253
They look like pop stars!

00:14:49.655 --> 00:14:50.952
They're beautiful!

00:14:51.557 --> 00:14:54.355
Ladies, would you care for
something to drink?

00:14:55.394 --> 00:14:57.930
Oh, oh, um, thanks!

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:00.057
Thank you for asking.
Yes, we'd love that.

00:15:00.432 --> 00:15:02.627
You've got a fabulous outfit!

00:15:04.136 --> 00:15:08.334
But it's nowhere near as fabulous
as your spectacular dress.

00:15:09.341 --> 00:15:13.178
Excuse me, would you mind if
I kiss your beautiful hand?

00:15:13.178 --> 00:15:14.813
No, um...

00:15:14.813 --> 00:15:17.349
Then could I kiss your lovely
strawberry-like lips?

00:15:17.349 --> 00:15:18.517
W.. Wait a second...

00:15:18.517 --> 00:15:20.041
Please wait a moment.

00:15:20.786 --> 00:15:25.189
The night is young, and besides,
there are many butterflies in the air.

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:29.893
N.. No way!

00:15:30.296 --> 00:15:32.164
Su.. Sunako is...

00:15:32.164 --> 00:15:34.533
Acting like a real lady.

00:15:34.533 --> 00:15:36.068
Isn't it great?

00:15:36.068 --> 00:15:37.303
This is perfect!

00:15:37.303 --> 00:15:39.066
Our efforts paid off!

00:15:39.538 --> 00:15:41.440
Where is it? Where is my prey?

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:42.074
Ladies and gentlemen!
Where is it? Where is my prey?

00:15:42.074 --> 00:15:44.009
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:15:44.009 --> 00:15:47.713
I'd like you all to meet my
precious little lamb,

00:15:47.713 --> 00:15:49.381
who has stolen the owner,
yours truly's , heart tonight!

00:15:49.381 --> 00:15:50.616
Little lamb?
who has stolen the owner,
yours truly's , heart tonight!

00:15:50.616 --> 00:15:51.014
who has stolen the owner,
yours truly's , heart tonight!

00:15:51.684 --> 00:15:53.379
Now open the curtain!

00:16:01.226 --> 00:16:02.523
What the heck?!

00:16:06.298 --> 00:16:07.466
Kyohei!

00:16:07.466 --> 00:16:09.195
Wh.. What's going on?

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:12.471
Tres bien!

00:16:12.471 --> 00:16:13.672
Harasho!

00:16:13.672 --> 00:16:15.140
Simply magnificent!

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:18.610
Observe his wiry body, which
looks like a captured tiger!

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:20.578
He's overflowing with youthful vibrance.

00:16:20.913 --> 00:16:22.414
Hey, how long are you planning to sleep?

00:16:22.414 --> 00:16:24.507
Come on, let them hear you moan
in pain or something!

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:26.010
Kyohei!

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:36.087
What the?!

00:16:39.164 --> 00:16:40.893
I'm gonna beat him up too!

00:16:41.333 --> 00:16:44.427
Noi, you stay right here.

00:16:53.879 --> 00:16:55.972
You look good in drag.

00:16:56.315 --> 00:16:58.317
Wh.. What's your point?!

00:16:58.317 --> 00:16:59.485
Love ya!

00:16:59.485 --> 00:17:01.783
Wh.. What do you think you're doing?!

00:17:01.887 --> 00:17:02.945
Huh?!

00:17:06.358 --> 00:17:07.960
What the?!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.495
She was wearing that underneath the kimono?!

00:17:09.495 --> 00:17:11.463
She changed the hair style and
put on the boots so fast!

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.727
Ho.. Ho.. Hold on a second!

00:17:23.108 --> 00:17:24.735
Ch.. Ch.. Chainsaw?!

00:17:27.679 --> 00:17:28.781
Sh.. She's so cool!

00:17:28.781 --> 00:17:30.578
Electrifying! Inspiring!
That's what I'm talking about!

00:17:32.684 --> 00:17:34.219
Where's the exit?

00:17:34.219 --> 00:17:37.017
Don't let her get away!
Get her! Get her!

00:17:38.891 --> 00:17:42.361
Young lady, it looks like you're
having too much fun.

00:17:42.361 --> 00:17:44.730
Just hand that precious little lamb to us!

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:46.095
To hell with that!

00:17:46.498 --> 00:17:50.594
This man is God's masterpiece!

00:17:53.872 --> 00:17:57.239
I won't let you scumbags lay
a single finger on him!

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:16.957
Sunako...

00:18:17.229 --> 00:18:19.060
Please don't kill anyone.

00:18:19.231 --> 00:18:20.632
Are you okay, Kyohei?

00:18:20.632 --> 00:18:23.035
Ta.. Takenaga!

00:18:23.035 --> 00:18:24.970
I was so scared!

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:26.171
There, there...

00:18:26.171 --> 00:18:27.206
Kyohei...

00:18:27.206 --> 00:18:28.639
I'm glad you're okay.

00:18:28.974 --> 00:18:31.477
You all look weird in drag.

00:18:31.477 --> 00:18:32.811
L.. Let's get out of here!

00:18:32.811 --> 00:18:33.812
Wait a minute!

00:18:33.812 --> 00:18:35.747
Everyone, please rest assured!

00:18:35.747 --> 00:18:37.983
We put safety before everything else, and...

00:18:37.983 --> 00:18:39.785
Hey, get him!

00:18:39.785 --> 00:18:41.753
We're gonna get him and give him to her!

00:18:42.121 --> 00:18:44.453
WHACK!

00:18:44.823 --> 00:18:47.917
Oh my god, the police are here!
Hurry up, everyone!

00:18:50.162 --> 00:18:52.289
Now it's time for the finishing touch!

00:18:54.133 --> 00:18:55.862
Just come with us!

00:18:56.468 --> 00:18:59.562
My store! The very crystallization of my beauty!

00:19:00.172 --> 00:19:02.163
I heard everything!

00:19:03.108 --> 00:19:05.235
My honey!

00:19:05.577 --> 00:19:08.046
Darling, I'm disappointed in you.

00:19:08.046 --> 00:19:11.316
You not only abduct a beautiful young man,
but make a spectacle of him on top of that!

00:19:11.316 --> 00:19:12.851
It is absolutely absurd!

00:19:12.851 --> 00:19:15.254
I did it to make you happy!

00:19:15.254 --> 00:19:17.856
Just keep your excuses to yourself!
I guess this is goodbye.

00:19:17.856 --> 00:19:19.057
What?!

00:19:19.057 --> 00:19:20.792
Iron ball, s'il vous plait!
What?!

00:19:20.792 --> 00:19:21.588
Roger!
What?!

00:19:27.432 --> 00:19:31.926
I'm sorry that our love didn't have
a glorious end, darling!

00:19:32.437 --> 00:19:34.928
Forever, adieu...

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:44.016
We should be safe here.

00:19:44.016 --> 00:19:45.142
Yeah...

00:19:45.717 --> 00:19:49.154
Hey, didn't you think Sunako was
such a lady in that kimono?

00:19:49.154 --> 00:19:51.323
Yeah, I guess she can do it
if she puts her mind to it.

00:19:51.323 --> 00:19:52.891
I've got him back now!

00:19:52.891 --> 00:19:53.559
Huh?

00:19:53.559 --> 00:19:53.659
Finally...
Huh?

00:19:53.659 --> 00:19:54.493
Finally...
Finally... Finally...

00:19:54.493 --> 00:19:55.227
Finally... Finally...
Finally... Finally...

00:19:55.227 --> 00:19:55.527
Finally... Finally...

00:19:55.527 --> 00:19:58.463
I can kill him with my own hands!

00:19:58.463 --> 00:20:01.200
I'll kill him! If I kill him! When I kill him!

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:03.802
What happened? She was so cool
up until a second ago!

00:20:03.802 --> 00:20:05.292
Now she's back to being creepy.

00:20:05.537 --> 00:20:05.671
Well, whatever...

00:20:05.671 --> 00:20:06.638
Well,
Well, whatever...

00:20:06.638 --> 00:20:07.798
Well, whatever...
Well, whatever...

00:20:08.774 --> 00:20:10.241
Thank you!

00:20:16.715 --> 00:20:19.551
What are you doing, Kyohei?!

00:20:19.551 --> 00:20:22.221
I know, I know, she must've been so terrified.

00:20:22.221 --> 00:20:23.188
Huh?

00:20:28.293 --> 00:20:29.728
Sunako!

00:20:29.728 --> 00:20:31.096
Get a hold of yourself!

00:20:31.096 --> 00:20:33.121
The party is tomorrow!

00:20:34.466 --> 00:20:36.335
The party has been cancelled!

00:20:36.335 --> 00:20:39.271
And I'm going to put this "free rent"
deal on hold for a while!

00:20:39.271 --> 00:20:41.340
WHAAAAAAT?!
What?! Why?!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:41.873
What?! Why?!

00:20:41.873 --> 00:20:44.376
What was that whole thing about
last night anyway?

00:20:44.376 --> 00:20:45.744
I need some explanations!

00:20:45.744 --> 00:20:47.980
Well, you see...

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.744
Who would've thought that the owner
was actually Auntie's darling?

00:20:51.083 --> 00:20:56.953
Good grief! Look what happened
to my beloved Sunako!

00:21:06.131 --> 00:21:08.066
Huh? What's going on?

00:21:08.066 --> 00:21:09.268
It's so long!

00:21:09.268 --> 00:21:10.669
That's my new darling!

00:21:10.669 --> 00:21:11.636
What?

00:21:11.837 --> 00:21:14.906
I've come to get you!

00:21:14.906 --> 00:21:16.897
It's long and lovely!

00:21:19.077 --> 00:21:20.145
So rich...

00:21:20.145 --> 00:21:21.213
Yeah, so rich.

00:21:21.213 --> 00:21:26.742
Listen, you must turn Sunako into an
elegant lady by the time I get back!

00:21:27.386 --> 00:21:31.186
Now let's go, darling!
To the kingdom of our love!

00:21:31.423 --> 00:21:34.226
Well then, Goodbye, my love.

00:21:34.226 --> 00:21:35.961
What language is that?

00:21:35.961 --> 00:21:38.259
Don't worry, those are the words of love!

00:21:41.767 --> 00:21:43.502
I wonder if that thing can make turns?

00:21:43.502 --> 00:21:44.992
I don't think so!

00:21:49.641 --> 00:21:51.009
Sunako?

00:21:51.009 --> 00:21:52.678
Holding a rose?

00:21:52.678 --> 00:21:54.446
She must have awoken to
aesthetic sensibilities!

00:21:54.446 --> 00:21:59.406
I'll kill him! If I kill him!
When I kill him! I'll kill him for sure!

00:22:01.019 --> 00:22:02.418
She's still scary!

00:22:02.487 --> 00:22:05.456
Oh, My Sweet Dark Youth

00:22:06.591 --> 00:22:11.153
What I managed to obliterate

00:22:14.232 --> 00:22:20.569
Was a bunch of blades

00:22:21.873 --> 00:22:29.245
I loved it like this, waiting, waiting

00:22:29.715 --> 00:22:36.951
With felt petals, waiting

00:22:37.622 --> 00:22:44.994
I can't see you anymore, waiting, waiting

00:22:45.731 --> 00:22:53.438
I just keep on waiting in a sea without you

00:22:53.438 --> 00:23:00.844
I loved it like this, waiting, waiting

00:23:01.113 --> 00:23:08.315
The felt petals, waiting

00:23:08.954 --> 00:23:12.224
We won't see each other anymore

00:23:12.224 --> 00:23:16.456
Waiting, waiting

00:23:17.195 --> 00:23:25.159
I will probably be waiting in a sea without you

00:23:31.309 --> 00:23:34.112
Have you heard that you can win some money
if your stall at the cultural festival is a hit?!

00:23:34.112 --> 00:23:35.080
I'm not interested.

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:36.181
Why? Why not?!

00:23:36.181 --> 00:23:37.449
I'd rather have fun with girls.

00:23:37.449 --> 00:23:38.650
That's so stupid! Just stupid!

00:23:38.650 --> 00:23:39.818
We go for love rather than money, right?

00:23:39.818 --> 00:23:41.153
Love will never fill me up!

00:23:41.153 --> 00:23:42.220
It's all about eating for him, isn't it?

00:23:42.220 --> 00:23:42.354
Sunako, You're Up!
It's all about eating for him, isn't it?

00:23:42.354 --> 00:23:44.322
Sunako, You're Up!
Next time on The Wallflower:
"Sunako, You're Up!"

00:23:44.322 --> 00:23:45.557
You have to watch it no matter what!

00:23:45.557 --> 00:23:47.081
I'm coming at you!

00:23:48.081 --> 00:23:58.081
